BaseItemCode,ProductStory
16WST,"Our Turtle Friendly Wildlife Lighting is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and complements both traditional and coastal architecture.  These fixtures elegantly combine the natural beauty of copper with the standards of low impact lighting. These lighting accessories are considered wildlife-friendly and have been approved for use in areas sensitive to the natural migration of sea turtles.    All wildlife-friendly products by The CopperSmith have been tested and certified by the Florida Fish and Wildlife Conservation Commission as compliant with the artificial lighting standards established by the Wildlife Lighting Certification Program.<br><br><br>• Certified wildlife-friendly design approved by the Florida Fish and Wildlife Conservation Commission.<br>• Fully shielded, downward-directed illumination reduces light pollution in coastal environments.<br>• Handcrafted from solid copper for exceptional durability and natural corrosion resistance<br>• Engineered to meet stringent sea turtle lighting regulations for beachfront communities.<br>• Electric illumination provides reliable, low-impact lighting for residential and commercial exteriors.<br>• Ideal for waterfront properties, coastal developments, and wildlife-sensitive outdoor areas."
