AM22E,"Our Biltmore® Amherst lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with ceiling mount, post mount, pier mount, yoke mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  The CopperSmith has partnered with Biltmore® to create several distinctive new lighting collections that reflect both companies’ shared passion for careful craftsmanship and timeless style. The CopperSmith’s mission to provide the finest selection of the highest quality copper lanterns available ensures that their designs honor Biltmore®’s commitment to authenticity and integrity while also offering a wide range of sophisticated lighting options for today’s homes and businesses.  Named to honor George Vanderbilt’s descendants, the elegant Biltmore® Biltmore® Amherst Lantern Collection is a warm welcome to those who appreciate timeless style.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
