AO28E,"Our Biltmore® Aurora lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with yoke mount, post mount, pier mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  Classic and elegant, the Biltmore® Aurora Collection pays homage to George Vanderbilt’s passion for collecting and displaying art. The stunning Library ceiling painting, The Chariot of Biltmore® Aurora, is one of many unique art pieces that remain in the collection today. The high quality and stunning Biltmore® Aurora Collection is a remarkable and artistic statement piece for your home.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
