BM30E,"Our Belmont lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with yoke mount, gooseneck mount, ceiling mount, post mount, pier mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  Belmont is a large, graceful design perfect for large homes and commercial buildings. Belmont is standard with the lovely Top & Bottom London finials as shown.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
BM30G,"Our Belmont lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides natural gas or propane for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with yoke mount, gooseneck mount, post mount, pier mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  Belmont is a large, graceful design perfect for large homes and commercial buildings. Belmont is standard with the lovely Top & Bottom London finials as shown.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Offered with natural gas or propane for a warm authentic flame.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Solid brass gas burner assemblies are CSA certified for safe reliable flame performance.<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
BM30W,"Bring the romance of a gas flame to outdoor spaces with the Belmont Weiyan® LED Flame Fixture. This handcrafted copper lantern includes the Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb and patented 110V flame simulation technology, using hammered glass to create a lifelike flicker with efficient LED performance. It is a refined Outdoor LED Fixture option for homeowners, designers, and builders who want the atmosphere of gas lighting without gas-line installation.  The Belmont 30 inch Weiyan® LED Flame Fixture is an outdoor LED fixture designed to deliver the warm look and ambiance of a traditional gas lantern in an electric format. Each fixture includes the Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb and uses hammered glass to properly refract the LED diodes for a realistic flame effect. Handcrafted from solid copper with solid brass hinges and latch hardware, this lantern combines patented flame simulation technology, energy-efficient LED performance, and the timeless character of copper without requiring a gas line.<br><br><br>• Outdoor LED fixture with included Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb<br>• Patented LED flame simulation technology creates the look and ambiance of a traditional gas flame<br>• 110V Weiyan® system uses hammered glass to properly refract LED diodes for a realistic flame effect<br>• Energy-efficient LED performance with approximately 5W to 8W power usage and up to 50,000 hours of continuous use<br>• Handcrafted solid copper copper construction that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latch hardware with mounts and accessories built from marine-grade aluminum"
