CO18E,"Our Contempo lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with yoke mount, gooseneck mount, ceiling mount, post mount, pier mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  A popular design from The CopperSmith, the Contempo Lanterns are the embodiment of sleek and contemporary. At home inside or out, the Contempo is a modern take on the traditional style gas light copper lantern.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
