CWS12,"Our Conception Street lantern is a solid copper up/down coastal wall sconce engineered for marine environments. It delivers clean bidirectional illumination ideal for architectural accents, entries, and outdoor living areas. Built from coastal-grade copper, it resists corrosion and enhances both modern and traditional coastal designs.  Elevate your home’s ambiance with the sleek and modern Coastal Wall Sconce. Crafted from high-quality solid copper, its minimalist cylindrical design seamlessly integrates into any decor style. This sconce provides soft, diffused lighting, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Whether flanking a mirror, illuminating a hallway, or accenting your living space, the Coastal Wall Sconce blends contemporary design with practical elegance.<br><br><br>• Constructed from solid copper that resists corrosion and ages into a warm, natural patina over time.<br>• Dual direction lighting casts both upward and downward beams to accentuate exterior architecture.<br>• Engineered for coastal durability with materials that withstand salt spray, humidity, and year round weather exposure.<br>• Marine grade aluminum mounting components feature a premium powder coat finish for enhanced longevity.<br>• LED compatible for energy efficient lighting output and long term performance.<br>• A modern coastal design perfect for elevating outdoor areas with functional and stylish illumination."
CWS16,"Our Conception Street lantern is a solid copper up/down coastal wall sconce engineered for marine environments. It delivers clean bidirectional illumination ideal for architectural accents, entries, and outdoor living areas. Built from coastal-grade copper, it resists corrosion and enhances both modern and traditional coastal designs.  Elevate your home’s ambiance with the sleek and modern Coastal Wall Sconce. Crafted from high-quality solid copper, its minimalist cylindrical design seamlessly integrates into any decor style. This sconce provides soft, diffused lighting, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Whether flanking a mirror, illuminating a hallway, or accenting your living space, the Coastal Wall Sconce blends contemporary design with practical elegance.<br><br><br>• Constructed from solid copper that resists corrosion and ages into a warm, natural patina over time.<br>• Dual direction lighting casts both upward and downward beams to accentuate exterior architecture.<br>• Engineered for coastal durability with materials that withstand salt spray, humidity, and year round weather exposure.<br>• Marine grade aluminum mounting components feature a premium powder coat finish for enhanced longevity.<br>• LED compatible for energy efficient lighting output and long term performance.<br>• A modern coastal design perfect for elevating outdoor areas with functional and stylish illumination."
DN23E,"Our Dinardi lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and complements both traditional and coastal architecture.  Just because your style is modern doesn’t mean you have to forgo the warm and welcoming glow of gas lighting. Named after architect Paul Dinardi, our new Dinardi collection perfectly enhances commercial and residential spaces. Go with a black finish for a contemporary look, or choose our solid copper finish for environments where transitional gas lighting is in order.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
DN23G,"Our Dinardi lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides natural gas or propane for everyday exterior use and complements both traditional and coastal architecture.  Just because your style is modern doesn’t mean you have to forgo the warm and welcoming glow of gas lighting. Named after architect Paul Dinardi, our new Dinardi collection perfectly enhances commercial and residential spaces. Go with a black finish for a contemporary look, or choose our solid copper finish for environments where transitional gas lighting is in order.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Offered with natural gas or propane for a warm authentic flame.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Solid brass gas burner assemblies are CSA certified for safe reliable flame performance.<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
