ES61E,"Our Eslava Street lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with yoke mount, gooseneck mount, ceiling mount, post mount, pier mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  Gasebastian de Eslava established the Viceroyalty of New Granada in 1717 to the jurisdiction of the Spanish Empire in South America. The exquisite traditional architecture of this region was the inspiration for the Eslava lantern family. The Eslava Street Collection, with its distinctive top finial, is a perfect compliment for medium to large homes and commercial projects. Mix and match gas and electric lanterns from the Eslava Street Collection for consistency of design throughout your project.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
ES61G,"Our Eslava Street lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides natural gas or propane for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with yoke mount, gooseneck mount, post mount, pier mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  Gasebastian de Eslava established the Viceroyalty of New Granada in 1717 to the jurisdiction of the Spanish Empire in South America. The exquisite traditional architecture of this region was the inspiration for the Eslava lantern family. The Eslava Street Collection, with its distinctive top finial, is a perfect compliment for medium to large homes and commercial projects. Mix and match gas and electric lanterns from the Eslava Street Collection for consistency of design throughout your project.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Offered with natural gas or propane for a warm authentic flame.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Solid brass gas burner assemblies are CSA certified for safe reliable flame performance.<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
ES61W,"Bring the romance of a gas flame to outdoor spaces with the Eslava Street Weiyan® LED Flame Fixture. This handcrafted copper lantern includes the Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb and patented 110V flame simulation technology, using hammered glass to create a lifelike flicker with efficient LED performance. It is a refined Outdoor LED Fixture option for homeowners, designers, and builders who want the atmosphere of gas lighting without gas-line installation.  The Eslava Street 61 inch Weiyan® LED Flame Fixture is an outdoor LED fixture designed to deliver the warm look and ambiance of a traditional gas lantern in an electric format. Each fixture includes the Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb and uses hammered glass to properly refract the LED diodes for a realistic flame effect. Handcrafted from solid copper with solid brass hinges and latch hardware, this lantern combines patented flame simulation technology, energy-efficient LED performance, and the timeless character of copper without requiring a gas line.<br><br><br>• Outdoor LED fixture with included Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb<br>• Patented LED flame simulation technology creates the look and ambiance of a traditional gas flame<br>• 110V Weiyan® system uses hammered glass to properly refract LED diodes for a realistic flame effect<br>• Energy-efficient LED performance with approximately 5W to 8W power usage and up to 50,000 hours of continuous use<br>• Handcrafted solid copper copper construction that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latch hardware with mounts and accessories built from marine-grade aluminum"
