GA32G,"Our Biltmore® Gala lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides natural gas or propane for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with post mount, pier mount, yoke mount, ceiling mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  The CopperSmith has partnered with Biltmore® to create several distinctive new lighting collections that reflect both companies’ shared passion for careful craftsmanship and timeless style. The CopperSmith’s mission to provide the finest selection of the highest quality copper lanterns available ensures that their designs honor Biltmore®’s commitment to authenticity and integrity while also offering a wide range of sophisticated lighting options for today’s homes and businesses.  The Vanderbilts were famous for their gracious hospitality and elegant style of entertaining, and our Biltmore® Gala Collection is a tribute to the beautifully-lighted events that graced the grand rooms of Biltmore® House.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Offered with natural gas or propane for a warm authentic flame.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Solid brass gas burner assemblies are CSA certified for safe reliable flame performance.<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
