GTTL,CopperSmith Georgetown Table Top Lantern
H6F,"Our Hawthorn lantern is a solid copper flush ceiling light designed for covered porches, breezeways, verandas, and outdoor living spaces. Its low-profile ceiling installation provides reliable illumination while maintaining a refined architectural presence. Built for coastal durability, it performs beautifully in harsh environments.  Our Hawthorn copper flush mount ceiling light creates a cozy and comfortable home atmosphere, ideal for any hallway, kitchen, foyer, sunroom, or porch. Certified for both indoor and outdoor use, the Hawthorn coordinates beautifully with our CopperSmith wall light collections.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Flush mount design provides low profile overhead lighting ideal for porches, covered patios, breezeways, and entryways.<br>• Engineered for both indoor and outdoor use with corrosion resistant materials that withstand humidity and coastal environments.<br>• Precision built marine grade components for durable construction and long term performance.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for efficient and reliable illumination.<br>• A timeless design that seamlessly pairs with traditional, coastal, and transitional architectural styles."
HL15E,"Our Hyland lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with yoke mount, gooseneck mount, post mount, pier mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  The Hyland Collection takes its name from the Hyland Estate in Essex, England. The towering corner columns on this estate were the primary inspiration for this design. The Hyland Collection combines contemporary and classic styling to create a timeless design for those looking for a simple, modern style. This lovely design is at home both inside and outside.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
HL15G,"Our Hyland lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides natural gas or propane for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with yoke mount, gooseneck mount, post mount, pier mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  The Hyland Collection takes its name from the Hyland Estate in Essex, England. The towering corner columns on this estate were the primary inspiration for this design. The Hyland Collection combines contemporary and classic styling to create a timeless design for those looking for a simple, modern style. This lovely design is at home both inside and outside.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Offered with natural gas or propane for a warm authentic flame.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Solid brass gas burner assemblies are CSA certified for safe reliable flame performance.<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
HL15W,"Bring the romance of a gas flame to outdoor spaces with the Hyland Weiyan® LED Flame Fixture. This handcrafted copper lantern includes the Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb and patented 110V flame simulation technology, using hammered glass to create a lifelike flicker with efficient LED performance. It is a refined Outdoor LED Fixture option for homeowners, designers, and builders who want the atmosphere of gas lighting without gas-line installation.  The Hyland 15 inch Weiyan® LED Flame Fixture is an outdoor LED fixture designed to deliver the warm look and ambiance of a traditional gas lantern in an electric format. Each fixture includes the Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb and uses hammered glass to properly refract the LED diodes for a realistic flame effect. Handcrafted from solid copper with solid brass hinges and latch hardware, this lantern combines patented flame simulation technology, energy-efficient LED performance, and the timeless character of copper without requiring a gas line.<br><br><br>• Outdoor LED fixture with included Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb<br>• Patented LED flame simulation technology creates the look and ambiance of a traditional gas flame<br>• 110V Weiyan® system uses hammered glass to properly refract LED diodes for a realistic flame effect<br>• Energy-efficient LED performance with approximately 5W to 8W power usage and up to 50,000 hours of continuous use<br>• Handcrafted solid copper copper construction that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latch hardware with mounts and accessories built from marine-grade aluminum"
HL18E,"Our Hyland lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with yoke mount, gooseneck mount, post mount, pier mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  The Hyland Collection takes its name from the Hyland Estate in Essex, England. The towering corner columns on this estate were the primary inspiration for this design. The Hyland Collection combines contemporary and classic styling to create a timeless design for those looking for a simple, modern style. This lovely design is at home both inside and outside.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
