HSI1,Frosted Hurricane Shade
HSI2,Sanded Hurricane Shade
IR14-CPKIT,"Our Islamorada RLM lantern is handcrafted from solid copper by CopperSmith artisans, built to develop a rich patina and provide years of service. Featuring a ceiling pendant mount, it provides focused lighting for both indoor and outdoor applications in residential or commercial settings. With a clean, utilitarian profile, it pairs classic RLM styling with premium materials.  Inspired by the moody allure of John Huston’s 1948 film noir, the Islamorada Collection honors the iconic RLM Dome Reflector lights by the Benjamin Company, which revolutionized industrial lighting design. Its solid copper shade, with a graceful curved dome, directs light downward, combining functionality with style. Whether as a wall mount, pendant, or stem fixture, the Islamorada brings cinematic elegance to any space.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Offered in multiple sizes and shade styles for both residential and commercial applications.<br>• Designed to provide focused, downward illumination ideal for signage, garages, porches, interior and exterior accents.<br>• Built with marine grade aluminum mounts and components for added strength and corrosion resistance.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for efficient, reliable performance.<br>• Engineered for long term outdoor durability with finishes that resist fading and wear."
