J4F,"Our Juniper lantern is a solid copper flush ceiling light designed for covered porches, breezeways, verandas, and outdoor living spaces. Its low-profile ceiling installation provides reliable illumination while maintaining a refined architectural presence. Built for coastal durability, it performs beautifully in harsh environments.  Our Juniper copper flush mount ceiling light creates a cozy and comfortable home atmosphere, ideal for any hallway, kitchen, foyer, sunroom, or porch. Certified for both indoor and outdoor use, the Juniper coordinates beautifully with our CopperSmith wall light collections.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Flush mount design provides low profile overhead lighting ideal for porches, covered patios, breezeways, and entryways.<br>• Engineered for both indoor and outdoor use with corrosion resistant materials that withstand humidity and coastal environments.<br>• Precision built marine grade components for durable construction and long term performance.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for efficient and reliable illumination.<br>• A timeless design that seamlessly pairs with traditional, coastal, and transitional architectural styles."
KL14-CPKIT,"Our Key Largo lantern is handcrafted from solid copper by CopperSmith artisans, built to develop a rich patina and provide years of service. Featuring a ceiling pendant mount, it provides focused lighting for both indoor and outdoor applications in residential or commercial settings. With a clean, utilitarian profile, it pairs classic RLM styling with premium materials.  The setting for the 1948 classic film noir by John Huston gave the Key Largo Collection its name, inspired by the Benjamin Company’s RLM Dome Reflector lights that had a profound influence on industrial illumination. The Key Largo’s solid copper shade features a stylish dome shape to ensure the light is illuminated downward, and it displays beautifully from a wall mount, pendent, or stem.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Offered in multiple sizes and shade styles for both residential and commercial applications.<br>• Built with marine grade aluminum mounts and components for added strength and corrosion resistance.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for efficient, reliable performance.<br>• Engineered for long term outdoor durability with finishes that resist fading and wear."
