KW14-CPKIT,"Our Key West RLM lantern is handcrafted from solid copper by CopperSmith artisans, built to develop a rich patina and provide years of service. Featuring a ceiling pendant mount, it provides focused lighting for both indoor and outdoor applications in residential or commercial settings. With a clean, utilitarian profile, it pairs classic RLM styling with premium materials.  The Key West Collection draws its name and inspiration from the 1948 classic film noir by John Huston, capturing the timeless elegance of the era. Reflecting the iconic design of Benjamin Company’s RLM Dome Reflector lights, which revolutionized industrial lighting, the Key West features a solid copper shade with a sleek fluted shape. Its focused downward illumination makes it perfect for wall mounting, pendant suspension, or stem support.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Offered in multiple sizes and shade styles for both residential and commercial applications.<br>• Designed to provide focused, downward illumination ideal for signage, garages, porches, interior and exterior accents.<br>• Built with marine grade aluminum mounts and components for added strength and corrosion resistance.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for efficient, reliable performance.<br>• Engineered for long term outdoor durability with finishes that resist fading and wear."
