MO23E,"Our Moneo lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with yoke mount, post mount, pier mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  Named after the infamous spanish architect Rafael Moneo, our Moneo lantern will leave an impression with its innovative design and linear composition that cultivates an air of classically chic. The Moneo collection perfectly combines design aesthetics with functionality, emphasized by both modern and transitional structures in today’s residential and commercial areas.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
MO23G,"Our Moneo lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides natural gas or propane for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with yoke mount, post mount, pier mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  Named after the infamous spanish architect Rafael Moneo, our Moneo lantern will leave an impression with its innovative design and linear composition that cultivates an air of classically chic. The Moneo collection perfectly combines design aesthetics with functionality, emphasized by both modern and transitional structures in today’s residential and commercial areas.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Offered with natural gas or propane for a warm authentic flame.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Solid brass gas burner assemblies are CSA certified for safe reliable flame performance.<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
