NV29E,"Our Navarrete lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and complements both traditional and coastal architecture.  Contemporary architect Alejandra Navarrete Llopis, famous for her works that seamlessly blend art and architecture, was the inspiration for our Navarrete collection. Created to compliment a wide array of settings and applications, the Navarrete was designed to create the ultimate in lighting enhancement with its modern profile and linear brackets, the display possibilities are nearly endless.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
