PC22E,"Our Pinnacle lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with yoke mount, ceiling mount, post mount, pier mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  As soon as you step foot into the Biltmore® House, it’s clear that no detail has been overlooked. You can feel the love and care that George Vanderbilt and his architect, Richard Morris Hunt, poured into every inch of the magnificent structure. The Pinnacle Collection is a testament to their passion for design and craftsmanship, inspired by the intricate stonework that forms a breathtaking peak above the front doors.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
