TE20E,"Our Terra lantern is designed for flush wall installation, offering a clean architectural profile ideal for entries, porches, and sheltered outdoor corridors. Handcrafted from solid copper, it provides electric illumination and delivers dependable performance in any climate.  The CopperSmith Terra Lantern is a popular design that lends itself to many different architectural styles. A flush mount light, Terra makes a great front, side, or rear entry light. Consider using Terra inside hallways or anywhere as a distinctive wall sconce.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
