TE22W,"Bring the romance of a gas flame to outdoor spaces with the Terra Weiyan® LED Flame Fixture. This handcrafted copper lantern includes the Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb and patented 110V flame simulation technology, using hammered glass to create a lifelike flicker with efficient LED performance. It is a refined Outdoor LED Fixture option for homeowners, designers, and builders who want the atmosphere of gas lighting without gas-line installation.  The Terra 22 inch Weiyan® LED Flame Fixture is an outdoor LED fixture designed to deliver the warm look and ambiance of a traditional gas lantern in an electric format. Each fixture includes the Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb and uses hammered glass to properly refract the LED diodes for a realistic flame effect. Handcrafted from solid copper with solid brass hinges and latch hardware, this lantern combines patented flame simulation technology, energy-efficient LED performance, and the timeless character of copper without requiring a gas line.<br><br><br>• Outdoor LED fixture with included Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb<br>• Patented LED flame simulation technology creates the look and ambiance of a traditional gas flame<br>• 110V Weiyan® system uses hammered glass to properly refract LED diodes for a realistic flame effect<br>• Energy-efficient LED performance with approximately 5W to 8W power usage and up to 50,000 hours of continuous use<br>• Handcrafted solid copper copper construction that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latch hardware with mounts and accessories built from marine-grade aluminum"
TLA,Turtle Light Adapter
TR19E,"Our Biltmore® Traveler lantern is crafted as a wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and can also be configured with ceiling mount, post mount, pier mount, yoke mount to suit a wide range of architectural applications.  The CopperSmith has partnered with Biltmore® to create several distinctive new lighting collections that reflect both companies’ shared passion for careful craftsmanship and timeless style. The CopperSmith’s mission to provide the finest selection of the highest quality copper lanterns available ensures that their designs honor Biltmore®’s commitment to authenticity and integrity while also offering a wide range of sophisticated lighting options for today’s homes and businesses. George Vanderbilt was a noted collector of fascinating treasures from many different parts of the world, and our distinctive Biltmore® Traveler Collection honors his journeys around the globe.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
