VR22E,"Our Viera lantern is crafted as a flush wall-mounted lantern, built from solid copper and designed to age gracefully with a natural patina. It provides electric illumination for everyday exterior use and complements both traditional and coastal architecture.  The Vieira Collection seamlessly integrates into it’s natural surroundings with a narrow profile and strong, linear style that compliments both modern or transitional environments. The sleek design pays homage to this lantern’s namesake, architect Vasco Vieira, famous for his contemporary works and simple yet inviting lines that are always in total harmony with their setting.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
