WS23E,"Our Water Street lantern is designed for flush wall installation, offering a clean architectural profile ideal for entries, porches, and sheltered outdoor corridors. Handcrafted from solid copper, it provides electric illumination and delivers dependable performance in any climate.  The Water Street Collection is rooted in the vintage aesthetic and charm found in New York City’s lower east side. The Water Street’s traditional design pays homage to lighting of the past and the bustling commercial district found along the river in the “city that never sleeps.” Place this lantern wherever a touch of classicism is needed.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture).<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
WS23G,"Our Water Street lantern is designed for flush wall installation, offering a clean architectural profile ideal for entries, porches, and sheltered outdoor corridors. Handcrafted from solid copper, it provides natural gas or propane and delivers dependable performance in any climate.  The Water Street Collection is rooted in the vintage aesthetic and charm found in New York City’s lower east side. The Water Street’s traditional design pays homage to lighting of the past and the bustling commercial district found along the river in the “city that never sleeps.” Place this lantern wherever a touch of classicism is needed.<br><br><br>• Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty.<br>• Offered with natural gas or propane for a warm authentic flame.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing.<br>• Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish.<br>• Solid brass gas burner assemblies are CSA certified for safe reliable flame performance.<br>• Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
WS23W,"Bring the romance of a gas flame to outdoor spaces with the Water Street Weiyan® LED Flame Fixture. This handcrafted copper lantern includes the Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb and patented 110V flame simulation technology, using hammered glass to create a lifelike flicker with efficient LED performance. It is a refined Outdoor LED Fixture option for homeowners, designers, and builders who want the atmosphere of gas lighting without gas-line installation.  The Water Street 23 inch Weiyan® LED Flame Fixture is an outdoor LED fixture designed to deliver the warm look and ambiance of a traditional gas lantern in an electric format. Each fixture includes the Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb and uses hammered glass to properly refract the LED diodes for a realistic flame effect. Handcrafted from solid copper with solid brass hinges and latch hardware, this lantern combines patented flame simulation technology, energy-efficient LED performance, and the timeless character of copper without requiring a gas line.<br><br><br>• Outdoor LED fixture with included Weiyan® LED Simulated Gas Flame bulb<br>• Patented LED flame simulation technology creates the look and ambiance of a traditional gas flame<br>• 110V Weiyan® system uses hammered glass to properly refract LED diodes for a realistic flame effect<br>• Energy-efficient LED performance with approximately 5W to 8W power usage and up to 50,000 hours of continuous use<br>• Handcrafted solid copper copper construction that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina.<br>• Solid brass hinges and latch hardware with mounts and accessories built from marine-grade aluminum"
